SUMMARY:Rooftop Comedy featuring Elliott White
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nEvery Thursday Modelface Comedy Club br
 ings the best local and touring comedians to Asheville! This week we have 
 Southern favorite Elliott White on the rooftop at Antidote!\nChemist Spirt
 s welcomes top comedians for a night of laughs. Enjoy a stunning AVL sunse
 t from the rooftop bar at Antidote while giggling and sipping a classic co
 cktail.\nElliott White is a Huntsville\, Alabama comedian and regular at L
 evity Live. Over the years\, he’s performed everywhere from comedy clubs
  to festivals that have since gone extinct. He has appeared on Comedy Cent
 ral’s Roast Battle and brings an easygoing\, conversational style to the
  stage. Whether he’s talking about dating\, race\, sex\, or the strange 
 situations life keeps putting him in\, Elliott makes audiences feel like t
 hey’re catching up with an old friend. one who occasionally says somethi
 ng wildly inappropriate.\n\nages 21+\n\ndoors at 7:30pm\, show at 8pm\nTic
 kets $18\n[https://www.eventbrite.com/.../rooftop-comedy-featuring...](htt
 ps://www.eventbrite.com/e/rooftop-comedy-featuring-elliott-white-tickets-1
 992458842032?aff=oddtdtcreator&fbclid=IwcGRvZgFleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFKa0
